WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.260
Every January, at Epiphany, French
families cut into a special cake.

2
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.990
Somewhere inside hides a tiny charm:

3
00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:10.310
«la fève». Whoever finds it...

4
00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.690
then what happens?

5
00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.900
Other traditions start arguments.

6
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.880
Can a town hall display
«une crèche de Noël»?

7
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.860
And should «la corrida» survive?

8
00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:22.140
Why do the French hide a charm in a cake,

9
00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:24.720
and which traditions now divide them?

10
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:29.260
In this mission, you'll spin a year
wheel of France's 11 public holidays,

11
00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:32.470
then fly to festivals
from Quebec to Senegal.

12
00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:34.590
Then you'll argue both sides:

13
00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:38.240
heritage worth protecting, or
a tradition that should change?

14
00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:42.050
Your mission: find out
what «la fève» brings,

15
00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:44.430
and which traditions split France today.
